# Disclaimer

## Not investment advice
CFO Bench is a research and evaluation tool. Nothing in this repository, including
code, datasets, scores, reports, or agent outputs, is investment, financial, legal,
tax, or accounting advice, or an offer or solicitation to buy or sell any security.
The authors are not a registered investment adviser, broker-dealer, or auditor, and
no fiduciary or advisory relationship is created by using this project.

## Benchmark results are not a guarantee
A score reflects performance on this benchmark's tasks at the time of the run. It does
not predict accuracy on other tasks, documents, or models, or after any change to the
agent. Like past performance, past scores do not guarantee future results. A high score
does not mean an agent is safe for production use.

## Not model validation
This project does not replace your organization's model risk management, validation,
audit, or compliance processes (for example, SR 11-7 style review). Material financial
decisions require qualified human review.

## Illustrative data and projections
Sample tasks, figures, and projections (including DCF, forecasting, and scenario
outputs) are illustrative and depend on stated assumptions. They are not forecasts
or predictions of any company's actual results.

